  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1281838/description_52b1c4aa-11d5-4216-bea9-c5e4bb6a8959.png\" width=\"356\" height=\"89\"></p>\n<p>Kaleidoscopic 是一款以色彩與 Minecraft 染料為核心的建築模組。每種顏色皆擁有獨立且獨特的紋理與專屬特性。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_201b7c0e-f409-4a1c-b1ee-be62d63ffdba.png\" width=\"468\" height=\"36\"></p>\n<h2><strong>功能特色</strong></h2>\n<p>本模組的所有功能均可透過設定檔自由啟用或停用！</p>\n<ul>\n<li>染色木門</li>\n<li>染色木製陷阱門</li>\n<li>染色梯子</li>\n<li>染色岩石 - 將染料與任何岩石（例如鵝卵石）混合即可製成！</li>\n<li>染色雕花岩石</li>\n<li>染色岩石磚</li>\n<li>染色岩石變體</li>\n<li>染色燈</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_201b7c0e-f409-4a1c-b1ee-be62d63ffdba.png\" width=\"468\" height=\"36\"></p>\n<h2><strong>整合相容</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>本模組已內建與其他模組的整合功能，確保能順暢搭配使用。</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/artsandcrafts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Arts &amp; Crafts</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carpentry-chisels\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Carpentry &amp; Chisels</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/delicate-dyes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Delicate Dyes</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_201b7c0e-f409-4a1c-b1ee-be62d63ffdba.png\" width=\"468\" height=\"36\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
